 xy from CHIIR 2027 (Mar 7-11)\; CHIIR 2026 ran Mar 22-26. Deadlines repea
 t the same 23:59 AoE days used by the 2026 and 2027 calls (abstract Oct 8
 \, paper Oct 15\, short and resource papers Oct 29). Call links refer to 
 CHIIR 2027. Size is an editorial estimate.
